{"3437690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Red Sun", "steam_appid": 3437690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/2f4143334e4ff3ed3f904ac40894b9cc.avif?t=1781730568\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/ecdcdbeed3c9b77f73890ebf5139f0cb.avif?t=1781730568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras_big/ecdcdbeed3c9b77f73890ebf5139f0cb.webp?t=1781730568 width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Red Sun </strong>is a flightcade game that takes place in a once-broken world, with challenging gameplay inspired by classic flight shooters and sci-fi titles of yesteryear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worked on by people who have done it before, <strong>Project Red Sun</strong> is at heart an exploration into the power of an ace, the voracity of the enemy, and what it means to be a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.poster.avif?t=1781730568\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.webm?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.mp4?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/fcb65c0361a70c7248bc242d01872e47.avif?t=1781730568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras_big/fcb65c0361a70c7248bc242d01872e47.webp?t=1781730568 width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in History, the Earth and its people are truly free through the dream of the First Republic. From Kurdistan to Kansas, from Dakar to the Indian Sea, everywhere on Earth a more perfect union is being built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the corporate armies of the Coalition seek to fragment the world again, all in the name of consumption and wealth as the contradictions of capital give way to its inevitable cruelty.<br><br>You are Wildcat 1 of the First Republic’s Air Vanguard: A test pilot caught in a surprise blitzkrieg, leading a ragtag flight in an all-out battle for the survival of the free world against the all-consuming Coalition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The odds against you are high, and the enemy has conquered worlds before; this is the time of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite this, these truths remain under your wings, stronger than any money can buy: Earth and its people are worth fighting for, <i><strong>and no one will save us but ourselves.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/7fe6d6cfc826b187188ef0bf9410dba1.poster.avif?t=1781730568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/7fe6d6cfc826b187188ef0bf9410dba1.webm?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/7fe6d6cfc826b187188ef0bf9410dba1.mp4?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/1f08f2502bba4c5e63d6823c287c843b.avif?t=1781730568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras_big/1f08f2502bba4c5e63d6823c287c843b.webp?t=1781730568 width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 20+ missions with its classic and refined combat flight action gameplay, <strong>Project Red Sun</strong> will let you dogfight, strike and lead the charge against an enemy that deserves to be destroyed while facing down airships, mercenaries, mega-structures, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bespoke inventory of aircraft and weapons at your disposal, you will join forces with the best of Humanity, flying across the world, in daring raids and operations ranging from convoy strikes to battles out of myth itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets and collectible destructables, collapse enemy infrastructure, and discover side objectives and further challenges as you once again become the ace Our World needs you to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/ff7732c27628b26c1edd6706b2371931.poster.avif?t=1781730568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/ff7732c27628b26c1edd6706b2371931.webm?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/ff7732c27628b26c1edd6706b2371931.mp4?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/523d5730d2378380721085d58cd064a3.avif?t=1781730568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras_big/523d5730d2378380721085d58cd064a3.webp?t=1781730568 width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly over every corner of a real, but forever changed, world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player campaign with 20+ missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemy types ranging from super structures, to airships, to &quot;collectible&quot; enemy aces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An escalating, stage-rush, boss-fight tower climb known as &quot;Wildcat Mode&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen specially designed aircraft with a myriad of variants and paint schemes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ familiar and new weapons to level the playing field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the city of Cleveland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/2d7a4ae13f679275e9e2b12327290815.poster.avif?t=1781730568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/2d7a4ae13f679275e9e2b12327290815.webm?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/2d7a4ae13f679275e9e2b12327290815.mp4?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/2f4143334e4ff3ed3f904ac40894b9cc.avif?t=1781730568\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/ecdcdbeed3c9b77f73890ebf5139f0cb.avif?t=1781730568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras_big/ecdcdbeed3c9b77f73890ebf5139f0cb.webp?t=1781730568 width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Red Sun </strong>is a flightcade game that takes place in a once-broken world, with challenging gameplay inspired by classic flight shooters and sci-fi titles of yesteryear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worked on by people who have done it before, <strong>Project Red Sun</strong> is at heart an exploration into the power of an ace, the voracity of the enemy, and what it means to be a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.poster.avif?t=1781730568\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.webm?t=1781730568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437690/extras/697cb58665864282f4665c58f818965f.mp4?t=1781730568\" typ